{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01513",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 7.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Hi, uh, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.37,
      "end_seconds": 12.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.66,
      "end_seconds": 20.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Um, so... tingling in my thumb and first fingers. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.23,
      "end_seconds": 24.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.21,
      "end_seconds": 28.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "About... well, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.2,
      "end_seconds": 42.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "Okay, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.43,
      "end_seconds": 57.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.47,
      "text": "It's worse with driving and night. A four out of ten, I suppose. Let me think, you know, I've also been waking at night with numb hands, for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.55,
      "end_seconds": 63.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.5,
      "end_seconds": 78.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.62,
      "end_seconds": 103.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, pulse 77, pressure 110 over 69. And temperature 36.9, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.62,
      "end_seconds": 106.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.5,
      "end_seconds": 109.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.36,
      "end_seconds": 114.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Alright, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.44,
      "end_seconds": 135.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Tapping over the wrist brings on the tingling and the thumb muscle is slightly thin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.67,
      "end_seconds": 146.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Any neck pain, weakness in the legs or pain in the shoulder at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.22,
      "end_seconds": 155.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.71,
      "text": "No neck pain, weakness in the legs or pain in the shoulder, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.3,
      "end_seconds": 159.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.03,
      "end_seconds": 163.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.41,
      "end_seconds": 169.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.02,
      "end_seconds": 173.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.35,
      "end_seconds": 176.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.03,
      "end_seconds": 187.87,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "Just part of my thyroid removed, years back. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.98,
      "end_seconds": 209.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.32,
      "end_seconds": 212.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Erm, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.13,
      "end_seconds": 233.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Okay, any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.21,
      "end_seconds": 235.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.84,
      "end_seconds": 241.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.02,
      "end_seconds": 255.66,
      "duration_seconds": 13.64,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I swim twice a week. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.78,
      "end_seconds": 277.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.84,
      "end_seconds": 284.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.71,
      "end_seconds": 289.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.98,
      "end_seconds": 296.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "I've got diabetes. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.9,
      "end_seconds": 312.13,
      "duration_seconds": 15.23,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, it points towards carpal tunnel syndrome. A pinched nerve in the neck is still possible. Wear a wrist splint at night. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.93,
      "end_seconds": 315.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Mm, thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}